WEBVTT

00:00:16.006 --> 00:00:17.674
(SINGING) Tears of pearl

00:00:17.924 --> 00:00:22.679
When the dragon
snapped up his best girl

00:00:22.846 --> 00:00:26.766
And the Billywig forgot to twirl

00:00:27.517 --> 00:00:31.438
When his sweetheart left him cold

00:00:31.771 --> 00:00:36.276
The unicorn done lost his horn

00:00:37.193 --> 00:00:38.820
And the hippogriff...

00:00:38.987 --> 00:00:40.405
(SIGHS) How's a guy
get a drink in this joint?

00:00:42.782 --> 00:00:44.284
What? Ain't you ever seen
a house-elf before?

00:00:45.285 --> 00:00:49.039
Uh, no, of course I have.
I love house-elves.

00:00:49.664 --> 00:00:51.124
My uncle is a house-elf.

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:54.127
(SCOFFS) Yeah.

00:00:57.130 --> 00:00:59.883
Six shots of Gigglewater
and a Lobe-Blaster, please.

00:01:07.724 --> 00:01:09.434
Are all No-Majs like you?

00:01:10.352 --> 00:01:13.146
No. I'm the only one like me.

00:01:15.982 --> 00:01:16.983
(LAUGHS)

00:01:17.817 --> 00:01:18.818
(GIGGLING)

00:01:21.029 --> 00:01:22.447
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:01:30.664 --> 00:01:31.998
REWARD WU HAN PO
WANTED JEREMIUS WARDWART

00:01:32.165 --> 00:01:34.000
I've arrested half of the people in here.

00:01:34.709 --> 00:01:35.961
You can tell me to mind my business,

00:01:36.127 --> 00:01:40.006
but I saw something
in that death potion back there.

00:01:41.716 --> 00:01:44.177
I saw you hugging that Second Salem boy.

00:01:45.095 --> 00:01:46.846
His name's Credence.

00:01:48.348 --> 00:01:49.766
His mother beats him.

00:01:52.602 --> 00:01:54.145
She beats all those kids she's adopted,

00:01:54.354 --> 00:01:56.523
but she seems to hate him the most.

00:01:58.483 --> 00:02:00.318
And she was the No-Maj you attacked?

00:02:02.028 --> 00:02:03.697
That's how I lost my job.

00:02:04.990 --> 00:02:07.659
I went for her in front of a meeting
of her crazy followers.

00:02:08.868 --> 00:02:10.495
They all had to be Obliviated.

00:02:10.662 --> 00:02:11.830
It was a big scandal.

00:02:12.288 --> 00:02:13.540
(WHISPERS) It's him.

00:02:14.457 --> 00:02:18.503
(SINGING) 'Cause love
drives all of us wild

00:02:19.921 --> 00:02:20.922
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

00:02:21.881 --> 00:02:23.883
So... (SIGHS)

00:02:26.261 --> 00:02:29.180
You're the guy
with the case full of monsters, huh?

00:02:29.347 --> 00:02:30.807
News travels fast.

00:02:32.392 --> 00:02:36.438
I was hoping you'd be able to tell me
if there've been any sightings.

00:02:37.564 --> 00:02:39.065
Tracks, that sort of thing.

00:02:41.234 --> 00:02:44.487
You got a pretty big price
on your head, Mr. Scamander.

00:02:45.572 --> 00:02:47.032
Why should I help you

00:02:47.907 --> 00:02:49.492
instead of turning you in?

00:02:49.826 --> 00:02:51.911
I take it I'll have to
make it worth your while.

00:02:53.204 --> 00:02:55.498
Um... Let's consider it a cover charge.

00:02:59.127 --> 00:03:00.128
(SCOFFS)

00:03:01.421 --> 00:03:03.923
MACUSA's offering more than that.

00:03:07.302 --> 00:03:08.553
Lunascope?

00:03:11.389 --> 00:03:12.891
I got five.

00:03:20.148 --> 00:03:21.775
Frozen Ashwinder egg.

00:03:22.025 --> 00:03:23.443
Oh, you see, now we're--

00:03:25.111 --> 00:03:26.154
Wait a minute.

00:03:28.573 --> 00:03:29.741
That's a...

00:03:30.033 --> 00:03:31.409
That's a Bowtruckle.

00:03:31.576 --> 00:03:33.787
-Right?
-(SQUEAKS)

00:03:33.953 --> 00:03:35.121
-No.
-Oh, come on.

00:03:35.288 --> 00:03:36.998
They pick locks, am I right?

00:03:37.499 --> 00:03:38.792
You're not having him.

00:03:40.376 --> 00:03:41.628
Well...

00:03:43.129 --> 00:03:45.799
Good luck getting back alive,
Mr. Scamander,

00:03:45.965 --> 00:03:47.801
what with the whole of MACUSA
on your back.

00:03:50.303 --> 00:03:51.554
NEWT: All right.

00:03:58.978 --> 00:03:59.979
(SQUEAKING)

00:04:00.522 --> 00:04:01.523
Pickett.

00:04:04.818 --> 00:04:05.819
GNARLAK: Oh...

00:04:06.402 --> 00:04:07.403
(SQUEAKING)

00:04:14.119 --> 00:04:17.622
Something invisible's been
wreaking havoc around 5th Avenue.

00:04:18.164 --> 00:04:20.500
You may want to check out
Macy's Department Store.

00:04:20.959 --> 00:04:22.252
Might have what you're looking for.

00:04:22.418 --> 00:04:23.503
Dougal.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:25.004
One last thing.

00:04:25.922 --> 00:04:28.508
There's a Mr. Graves who works at MACUSA.

00:04:29.342 --> 00:04:31.427
I was wondering what you knew
of his background.

00:04:31.594 --> 00:04:35.932
You ask a lot of questions, Mr. Scamander.

00:04:37.350 --> 00:04:38.810
That can get you killed.

00:04:42.522 --> 00:04:43.773
MACUSA are comin'.

00:04:44.107 --> 00:04:45.316
You tipped them off?

00:04:45.525 --> 00:04:47.152
-(LAUGHING)
-(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:04:48.444 --> 00:04:49.946
WANTED NEWT SCAMANDER
PORPENTINA GOLDSTEIN

00:04:53.741 --> 00:04:55.368
Sorry, Mr. Gnarlak.

00:04:58.204 --> 00:04:59.706
He reminds me of my foreman.

00:05:08.089 --> 00:05:09.424
(SQUEAKING)

00:05:11.426 --> 00:05:12.427
(GIGGLES)

00:05:31.946 --> 00:05:33.156
MODESTY: Whatcha doin', Credence?

00:05:40.747 --> 00:05:41.873
CREDENCE: Where'd you get this?

00:05:42.248 --> 00:05:43.583
Give it back, Credence.

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:45.501
It's just a toy.

00:05:50.256 --> 00:05:51.716
What is this?

00:05:56.012 --> 00:05:57.430
Take it off.

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:25.166
-Ma--
-I am not your ma.

00:06:27.252 --> 00:06:28.920
Your mother

00:06:29.087 --> 00:06:32.465
was a wicked, unnatural woman.

00:06:33.925 --> 00:06:35.218
It was mine.

00:06:36.928 --> 00:06:37.971
Modesty.

00:06:39.138 --> 00:06:40.139
(CLINKS)

00:06:48.189 --> 00:06:49.190
(GASPS)

00:06:50.984 --> 00:06:52.277
What is this?

